OL,3,GNEWSAChildren 'missing out' over school
OL,4,Ataxi issues
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a girl with special
OL,7,Feducational needs has said the
OL,8,FEducation Authority (EA) needs to be
OL,9,Fheld to account after her daughter was
OL,10,Fleft without transport ahead of the new
OL,11,Fschool year.
OL,13,FLaura McDonnell's eight-year-old
OL,14,Fdaughter Evie had previously been
OL,15,Fprovided with a taxi for the 40-mile
OL,16,Fround trip from her home in Londonderry
OL,17,Fto Rossmar Special School in Limavady.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
PN,41602
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F416A1788258356
OL,1,W5j 5Q7k jjs%wsj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAChildren 'missing out' over school
OL,4,Ataxi issues
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut last week the family were told a
OL,7,Ftaxi is no longer available as the EA
OL,8,Fhad put the taxi contract out to
OL,9,Ftender. The BBC has asked the EA for
OL,10,Fcomment.
OL,12,F"I just felt so let down and frustrated
OL,13,Fand unsupported by the system,"
OL,14,FMcDonnell said.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
